# Flutter Testing

## Test Types

- **Widget tests** for UI components
- **Unit tests** for business logic (services, repositories, utilities)
- **Integration tests** for full user flows

## Rules

- No mocking of databases — use real in-memory databases
- Use `pump()` for single frame advance, `pumpAndSettle()` for animations to complete
- Test error states and edge cases, not just happy paths
- Golden tests for visual regression (optional but recommended)
- Follow AAA pattern: Arrange, Act, Assert

## Integration Test Navigation

- Use the AppRouter, initialize the first route
- Navigate using tap-on-button approach (simulate real user behavior)
- Avoid manual widget pumping or manual router navigation in integration tests

## Test Structure

```
test/
  unit/          # Business logic tests
  widget/        # Widget tests
  integration/   # Full flow tests
```

## Coverage

- 80%+ coverage for business logic
- All reusable components must have widget tests
- Critical user flows must have integration tests
